      "best_program": "// generated from the feature spec and the port plan; DSE mutates values only\n// constraint: storage_bits <= 1.57286e+06 (iso-192KiB). A candidate that breaks it is not built.\n#pragma once\n#define SR_NUM_BANKS 8  // range: [1, 16]\n#define SR_WT0_ENTRIES 512  // range: [128, 2048] pow2\n#define SR_WT1_ENTRIES 256  // range: [64, 1024] pow2\n#define SR_WT2_ENTRIES 128  // range: [32, 512] pow2\n#define SR_WT_CTR_BITS 6  // range: [3, 8]\n#define SR_UT_ENTRIES 8  // range: [4, 32] pow2\n#define SR_UT_CTR_BITS 6  // range: [2, 8]\n#define SR_DIGEST_WIDTH 12  // range: [4, 12]\n#define SR_ROB_TAG_BITS 14  // range: [10, 16]\n#define SR_DECAY_INTERVAL 256  // range: [32, 2048] pow2\n#define SR_MULTIPLIER_USEFUL 2.5  // range: [1.0, 4.0]\n#define SR_USEFULNESS_THRESHOLD 0  // range: [-16, 16]\n// host knobs: the host's own structures, at the clean tree's values by default\n#define HOST_LOGG 11  // range: [8, 12]; sets LOGG\n#define HOST_TBITS 8  // range: [6, 10]; sets TBITS\n#define HOST_NBANKLOW 10  // range: [4, 16]; sets NBANKLOW\n#define HOST_NBANKHIGH 20  // range: [10, 30]; sets NBANKHIGH\n#define HOST_CWIDTH 3  // range: [2, 4]; sets CWIDTH\n#define HOST_UWIDTH 1  // range: [1, 2]; sets UWIDTH\n#define HOST_LOGB 14  // range: [10, 16]; sets LOGB\n#define HOST_HYSTSHIFT 2  // range: [1, 4]; sets HYSTSHIFT\n#define HOST_PERCWIDTH 6  // range: [4, 8]; sets PERCWIDTH\n#define HOST_LOGBIAS 8  // range: [6, 10]; sets LOGBIAS\n#define HOST_LOGGNB 11  // range: [8, 12]; sets LOGGNB\n#define HOST_LOGPNB 10  // range: [7, 11]; sets LOGPNB\n#define HOST_LOGLNB 11  // range: [8, 12]; sets LOGLNB\n#define HOST_LOGSNB 10  // range: [7, 11]; sets LOGSNB\n#define HOST_LOGTNB 10  // range: [8, 12]; sets LOGTNB\n#define HOST_LOGINB 9  // range: [6, 10]; sets LOGINB\n#define HOST_LOGIMNB 10  // range: [7, 11]; sets LOGIMNB\n#define HOST_LOGL 5  // range: [3, 8]; sets LOGL\n#define HOST_EWIDTH 6  // range: [4, 8]; sets EWIDTH\n// storage_bits is the sum of these, in bits:\n//   register_status_table: 65 * (1 + max(SR_ROB_TAG_BITS, SR_DIGEST_WIDTH) + log2(SR_DECAY_INTERVAL))\n//   usefulness_weight_tables: 65 * 3 * SR_UT_ENTRIES * SR_UT_CTR_BITS\n//   prediction_weight_tables: SR_NUM_BANKS * (SR_WT0_ENTRIES + SR_WT1_ENTRIES + SR_WT2_ENTRIES) * SR_WT_CTR_BITS\n//   host tagged tables, high banks: HOST_NBANKHIGH * 2 ** HOST_LOGG * (HOST_CWIDTH + HOST_UWIDTH + HOST_TBITS + 4)\n//   host tagged tables, low banks: HOST_NBANKLOW * 2 ** HOST_LOGG * (HOST_CWIDTH + HOST_UWIDTH + HOST_TBITS)\n//   host use-alt-on-NA counters: 2 ** 4 * 5\n//   host bimodal, with shared hysteresis: 2 ** HOST_LOGB + 2 ** (HOST_LOGB - HOST_HYSTSHIFT)\n//   host global history, m[NHIST]: 3000\n//   host path history: 27\n//   host TICK counter: 10\n//   host loop predictor: 2 ** HOST_LOGL * (2 * 10 + 10 + 4 + 4 + 1)\n//   host loop predictor, counted again inside SC: 2 ** HOST_LOGL * (2 * 10 + 10 + 4 + 4 + 1)\n//   host SC thresholds and component weights: 12 + 8 * 2 ** 6 + 3 * HOST_EWIDTH * 2 ** 3\n//   host SC bias tables: HOST_PERCWIDTH * 3 * 2 ** HOST_LOGBIAS\n//   host SC global GEHL: (3 - 2) * 2 ** HOST_LOGGNB * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 2 ** (HOST_LOGGNB - 1) * 2 * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 40\n//   host SC path GEHL: (3 - 2) * 2 ** HOST_LOGPNB * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 2 ** (HOST_LOGPNB - 1) * 2 * HOST_PERCWIDTH\n//   host SC first local: (3 - 2) * 2 ** HOST_LOGLNB * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 2 ** (HOST_LOGLNB - 1) * 2 * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 256 * 11 + HOST_EWIDTH * 2 ** 3\n//   host SC second local: (3 - 2) * 2 ** HOST_LOGSNB * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 2 ** (HOST_LOGSNB - 1) * 2 * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 16 * 16 + HOST_EWIDTH * 2 ** 3\n//   host SC third local: (2 - 2) * 2 ** HOST_LOGTNB * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 2 ** (HOST_LOGTNB - 1) * 2 * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 16 * 9 + HOST_EWIDTH * 2 ** 3\n//   host SC IMLI: 2 ** (HOST_LOGINB - 1) * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 8 + 2 * 2 ** (HOST_LOGIMNB - 1) * HOST_PERCWIDTH + 2 * HOST_EWIDTH * 2 ** 3 + 256 * 10\n//   host chooser counters: 2 * 7\n",
